  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 4 Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - We are almost done with our transformer! But first, we need to build a DECODER.
  - The DECODER is very similar to the ENCODER. First you create the POSITIONAL EMBEDDING
    with previous output tokens or padding tokens if none were made before.
  - Then you pass the result through ATTENTION. Don't forget to add the residual
    connections and normalizing the result!
  - Then you pass it through to another ATTENTION mechanism, but feed the output
    embedding of the ENCODER into the VALUE and KEY slots. Be sure to pick the correct
    weights for the mixed ATTENTION!
  - Finally, you finish off the same way as the ENCODER. Pass the normalized output
    into a NEURAL NETWORK, add the residual, and normalize one last time.
